&lt;p&gt;Work closely with our design team to shape experiences that feel simple, clear, and genuinely helpful for our users. We’re looking for someone who likes to explore, try things out, and isn’t afraid to experiment. You’ll be thinking through layouts, visuals, and hierarchy, and using words to make ideas land clearly. From campaign creatives and in-app moments to small bits of microcopy, you’ll explore how design and language work together, experiment with different approaches, and learn what helps financial ideas feel simple and inviting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying design or recently graduated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that shows how you think, including college work, personal projects,&lt;br&gt;or freelance work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of visual craft with a good eye for layout, hierarchy, and composition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how words and visuals work together to make ideas clearer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using tools like Figma or Adobe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about fintech and interested in making finance feel simple and accessible is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to feedback and willing to iterate on your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly and enjoys collaborating with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive, and eager to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll gain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience working on real projects, along with guidance and feedback from experienced designers and writers. You’ll get a behind-the-scenes look at how ideas go from concept to launch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 6 months&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; on-site&lt;/p&gt;

